SUMMARY:Mike Albert's Gospel Show featuring The Stamps Quartet
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $39 \nIt’s no secret “The King” loved Gospel music. In fact\, the three wins of Elvis’ 14 Grammy nominations were for Gospel recordings\, including the album How Great Thou Art. In his own special way\, the one and only Mike Albert reveals Elvis’ Gospel side. His renditions of these sacred songs are so realistic you’ll think Elvis himself has returned! Joining Mike Albert will be Gospel music legends The Stamps Quartet. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/mike-alberts-gospel-show-featuring-the-stamps-quartet/
